す。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "（2025年５月９日発表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 16, "16.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 16, "16.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 3, "3.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 3, "3.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 14, "14.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 14, "14.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["NoteToDividends", "NoteToDividends", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "なお、本件は2026年6月に開催予定の第67期定時株主総会の決議を経て実行することとなります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "当社は株主の皆様に対する利益還元を重要な経営課題として捉えており、財務体質の強化と内部留保の充実（自己資本比率の向上）を勘案しつつ、安定した配当政策を実施することを基本方針としております。また、2025年５月に公表したグループ中期経営計画（2025～2027年度）において、『得られた利益を1.「企業価値の向上に資する投資戦略の増強」並びに2.「連結配当性向30％程度を目途とした株主還元」の２点に振り向けることを、より強く意識して実行してまいります。』と、新たな方針を掲げました。　 2026年３月期の期末配当につきましては、これまで1株当たり16円としていましたが、通期連結業績予想が当初予想を下回ることになったことを踏まえ、誠に遺憾ではありますが、1株当たり３円に修正させていただきます。株主の皆様には深くお詫び申し上げますとともに、業績回復に努めてまいりますので、ご理解を賜りますようお願い申し上げます。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026-03-31", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}